# The tool's venv on the workstation (`just setup`): what it needs, by name. requirements.txt is
# compiled from this and is what is installed, every version exact:
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.12 requirements.in -o requirements.txt
# (`just pins install uv` when uv is not on PATH). A bump is a recompile, reviewed as a commit.
# A plugin locks its own the same way (its requirements.in -> requirements.txt), constrained by
# this lock so the packages they share agree; `just setup` installs this one, then each plugin's.
